WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Head, I, the Haoran sect, am an orthodox sect.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:05,800
What qualifications does he, a demon cultivator, have to compete with me for the position of the Holy Son?

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,200
Just because he is the talent that our ancestors like

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,640
So you want the Sonship

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:13,120
Then prove that you are more talented than him

6
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,200
Okay, that's the case

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,520
I will prove that my ancestor was mistaken.

8
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,560
You go down

9
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:22,040
Three days later, the battle for the throne of the Holy Son will begin.

10
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,920
Have you ever seen my little junior sister?

11
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:30,350
Senior brother, junior sister, she

12
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,360
Junior sister, what happened to her?

13
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:33,680
Junior sister, she cheated on her

14
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:45,620
My God, they are illiterate and can't read.

15
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,930
There isn’t even a book with patterns on the exercises.

16
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,530
What are you doing here?

17
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:53,020
Brother Gongfa has made you a garbage dump.

18
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,420
This old man must be literate

19
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,540
I asked him if it would be OK or not

20
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,820
If this spreads out, the Holy Son of Haoran Sect will be illiterate.

21
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,220
It’s better not to waste the position of my Holy Son.

22
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:02,900
This guy is so sinister

23
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:04,340
Isn't it because the cultivation spirit has become unstable?

24
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:06,020
Yes, yes, Elder Dong, you are right.

25
00:01:06,020 --> 00:01:07,820
I'll make sure to pack all of this when I leave.

26
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,020
remember what you said

27
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,900
Otherwise, even if you have the ancestor token in the future,

28
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:11,900
I won't let you in either

29
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:18,260
I don’t believe it anymore

30
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:21,260
There are so many exercises that are not explained in one book with pictures.
